### B. 核心指令與慣例
```bash
# 逐 application 掃描(取代逐 package cargo clippy)
RUSTC_WRAPPER=clippy-driver cargo check

# defconfig 內的版號釘定(僅對 =y 的 package 有效)
BR2_PACKAGE_<PKG>_REV="clippy-scan-binary-packages-3-nos7"

# diff 一律加 --no-ext-diff(放在 diff 之後),避免叫出 meld
git diff --no-ext-diff -- configs/tn_bseries_defconfig configs/edsg4000_defconfig

# canary 還原
git -C dl/rust_moxa_common checkout -- src/lib.rs
```

